                  "output": "\nIMPORTANT: The file content has been truncated.\nStatus: Showing lines 1-150 of 210 total lines.\nAction: To read more of the file, you can use the 'start_line' and 'end_line' parameters in a subsequent 'read_file' call. For example, to read the next section of the file, use start_line: 151.\n\n--- FILE CONTENT (truncated) ---\n\\documentclass[10pt,letterpaper]{article}\n\n\\usepackage[margin=0.5in]{geometry}\n\\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage{array}\n\\usepackage{xcolor}\n\\usepackage{calc}\n\n% Define the blue from the PDF\n\\definecolor{color1}{HTML}{2F5597}\n\n% Two complementary fonts:\n\\usepackage[varqu,varl]{inconsolata} % Consolas-like fixed width font for headings/titles/special\n\\usepackage{tgheros}   % Helvetica clone (Sans) for body content\n\n% Default text to sans-serif for body\n\\renewcommand{\\familydefault}{\\sfdefault}\n\n% Make links underlined explicitly, without boxes\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage[normalem]{ulem}\n\\newcommand{\\myhref}[2]{\\href{#1}{\\uline{#2}}}\n\n% No page numbers\n\\pagestyle{empty}\n\n% Redefine section to look like the PDF\n\\makeatletter\n\\renewcommand{\\section}[1]{%\n  \\par\\vspace{8pt}%\n  \\noindent\\colorbox{color1}{%\n    \\makebox[\\dimexpr\\textwidth-2\\fboxsep\\relax][c]{%\n      \\textcolor{white}{\\ttfamily\\bfseries\\large\\strut \\MakeUppercase{#1}}%\n    }%\n  }%\n  \\par\\vspace{4pt}%\n}\n\\makeatother\n\n\\begin{document}\n\n\\begin{center}\n    {\\ttfamily\\Huge\\color{color1} FRANCO N. COLAIZZI}\\\\[0.2em]\n    {\\sffamily\\small\n        412-721-9550\n        ~|~ \\myhref{mailto:fnc314@gmail.com}{fnc314@gmail.com} \n        ~|~ \\myhref{https://www.fnc314.dev}{www.fnc314.dev} \n        ~|~ \\myhref{https://blog.fnc314.dev}{blog.fnc314.dev}\n        ~|~ \\myhref{https://linkedin.com/in/fnc314}{linkedin.com/in/fnc314} \n        ~|~ Pittsburgh, PA\n    }\n\\end{center}\n\n\\vspace{4pt}\n\n\\begin{center}\n    \\colorbox{color1}{\\makebox[\\dimexpr\\textwidth-2\\fboxsep\\relax]{\\textcolor{white}{\\ttfamily\\bfseries\\large\\strut PRINCIPAL ANDROID SOFTWARE ENGINEER}}}\n\\end{center}\n\\vspace{2pt}\n\n% ============================================================\n%     PROFILE STATEMENT\n% ============================================================\n\\vspace{4pt}\n{\\sffamily Principal Android Software Engineer with 10+ years of experience defining technical strategy and architecture for large-scale mobile platforms. Proven track record of leading cross-functional teams through major architectural transformations across Android and distributed backend systems. Trusted by leadership to foster engineering excellence, standardize best practices, reduce technical debt, and align technical initiatives with business value.}\n\\vspace{6pt}\n\n% ============================================================\n%     AREAS OF EXPERTISE\n% ============================================================\n\\section{AREAS OF EXPERTISE}\n\\vspace{1pt}\n\\begin{center}\n\\sffamily\n\\renewcommand{\\arraystretch}{1.5}\n\\begin{tabular*}{\\textwidth}{@{\\extracolsep{\\fill}} l c r @{}}\nAndroid Development & Modern API Standards & Code Maintenance / DevEx \\\\\nMobile / Web Applications & Cross-Functional Collaboration & Accessibility Compliance \\\\\nSoftware Architecture & Stakeholder Alignment & Leadership / Mentoring \\\\\n\\end{tabular*}\n\\end{center}\n\\vspace{4pt}\n\n% ============================================================\n%     TECHNICAL SKILLS\n% ============================================================\n\\section{TECHNICAL SKILLS}\n\\vspace{1pt}\n\\begin{itemize}[label={}, leftmargin=0pt, itemsep=2pt, parsep=0pt]\n\\item {\\ttfamily\\large\\color{color1} Programming Languages:} {\\sffamily Kotlin | Java | JavaScript/TypeScript | Bash}\n\\item {\\ttfamily\\large\\color{color1} Frameworks \\& Libraries:} {\\sffamily Android | Kotlin Multiplatform | Jetpack Compose | Coroutines/Flow | MV