                "response": {
                  "output": "%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n% Cover Letter - Baxter International Inc., Principal Software Engineer - Android\n%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\n\\documentclass[]{cover}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage[normalem]{ulem}\n\\newcommand{\\myhref}[2]{\\href{#1}{\\uline{#2}}}\n\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\n\\rfoot{Page \\thepage \\hspace{0pt}}\n\\thispagestyle{empty}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0pt}\n\\begin{document}\n\n%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n%     TITLE NAME\n%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\\namesection{}{\\Huge{Franco N. Colaizzi}}{  \\myhref{mailto:fnc314@gmail.com}{fnc314@gmail.com} | 412-721-9550 | \\urlstyle{same}\\myhref{https://www.fnc314.dev}{www.fnc314.dev} | \\urlstyle{same}\\myhref{https://blog.fnc314.dev}{blog.fnc314.dev} | \\urlstyle{same}\\myhref{https://linkedin.com/in/fnc314}{linkedin.com/in/fnc314}\n}\n\n%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n%     MAIN COVER LETTER CONTENT\n%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\n\\currentdate{\\today}\n\\lettercontent{Dear Baxter Healthcare Hiring Team,}\n\n\\lettercontent{I am applying for the Principal Software Engineer – Android position at Baxter International. Baxter's mission to power connected clinical applications across global product ecosystems through shared, resilient platform foundations directly mirrors my 10+ years of technical leadership designing robust Android architectures, reusable SDKs, and high-consequence connected device interfaces.}\n\n\\lettercontent{Throughout my career serving as Lead Architect for flagship enterprise Android platforms (3.5M+ MAU) and mentoring 25+ engineers, I have treated shared platform libraries, strict engineering contracts, and developer enablement as core disciplines. Backed by a B.S. in Mathematics and deep production fluency in Kotlin, Coroutines, Gradle, and secure peripheral integrations, I bring proven experience delivering on Baxter's platform priorities:}\n\n{\\raggedright\\fontspec[Path = OpenFonts/fonts/raleway/]{Raleway-Medium}\\fontsize{11pt}{13pt}\\selectfont\n\\begin{itemize}\n    \\item \\textbf{Shared Platform Architecture \\& Multi-Product Modularization:} Decomposed a monolithic 3.5M+ MAU enterprise Android codebase into a structured multi-module repository, cutting build times by 70\\% while establishing reusable service foundations that decoupled feature teams.\n    \\item \\textbf{Connected Device \\& Peripheral Integration:} Spearheaded in-app payment and peripheral communication integrating paired Bluetooth (BLE) hardware and external SDKs, delivering resilient local communication protocols under stringent reliability requirements.\n    \\item \\textbf{High-Reliability Security \\& Modern API Standards:} Delivered an Android FIDO authenticator proof-of-concept spring-boarding institutional adoption of Samsung Knox/MFA, and migrated 10M+ active users to modern authentication infrastructure with zero downtime.\n    \\item \\textbf{Engineering Standards, DevEx \\& Multi-Squad Enablement:} Engineered automated Gradle module-generation workflows and credential automation reducing onboarding time by 80\\%, while authoring \\myhref{https://blog.fnc314.dev}{\\textit{\"Taming the Elephant Herd\"}} on build optimization.\n\\end{itemize}\\par}\n\\vspace{6pt}\n\n\\lettercontent{Designing platform architecture for clinical software demands uncompromising rigor, deterministic testing, and clear contracts between platform services and consuming product squads. Having established 'best-practice-by-default' philosophies across complex enterprise environments, I am excited by Baxter's commitment to advancing healthcare delivery and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my platform background will support your clinical teams.}\n\n\\begin{flushright}\n\\closing{Kind regards,}\n\n\\signature{Franco N. Colaizzi}\n\\end{flushright}\n\\end{document}\n"
