bf{\\ttfamily\\large\\color{color1} 08/2014 - 01/2026}\\\\\n\\textbf{\\ttfamily\\normalsize\\color{color1} CGI} \\hfill \\textbf{\\ttfamily\\normalsize\\color{color1} PITTSBURGH, PENNSYLVANIA}\\vspace{2pt}\\\\\n{\\itshape\\sffamily Served as a technical expert, mentoring peer engineers and defining architectural strategy for enterprise applications across clients including PNC Financial Services, PPG Industries, and Samsung Electronics. Founded the CGI I.T. Girl Challenge, authoring foundational documentation and onboarding community partners including Pittsburgh Public Schools.}\\vspace{1pt}\n}\n\n% --- PNC Android Tech Lead ---\n\\item{\n\\textbf{\\ttfamily\\normalsize Android Mobile Project Tech Lead} \\hfill \\textbf{\\ttfamily\\normalsize\\color{color1} 01/2020 - 06/2025}\\\\\n\\textbf{\\ttfamily\\small\\color{color1} PNC Financial Services (Client)} \\hfill \\textbf{\\ttfamily\\small\\color{color1} PITTSBURGH, PENNSYLVANIA}\\vspace{2pt}\\\\\n{\\itshape\\sffamily Lead Architect for the flagship Android app (3.5M+ MAU), designing the mobile-to-backend interface for a highly resilient, high-volume in-app payment processing platform.}\\vspace{2pt}\n\\begin{itemize}[label=\\textbullet, leftmargin=15pt, itemsep=1pt, parsep=0pt]\n    \\item {\\sffamily Modularized the entire codebase from a single ``god-module'' into a properly organized multi-module repository, reducing build times by 70\\% and isolating code contributions thereby reducing conflicts in merges.}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Automated credential setup and environment validation with custom Bash scripts, reducing developer onboarding time by 80\\%.}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Set technical standards and drove adoption across teams, breaking down complex initiatives into executable phases.}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Drove the implementation of in-app card payment acceptance integrating with a paired Bluetooth (BLE) card-reader device and third-party SDK.}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Produced comprehensive technical documentation to facilitate knowledge sharing and maintain feature parity.}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Partnered with Product and UX leadership to define roadmaps, aligning high-impact technical debt reduction with business value for stakeholders.}\n\\end{itemize}\n}\n\n% --- PNC Mobile Redesign ---\n\\item{\n\\textbf{\\ttfamily\\normalsize Mobile Redesign Architect Lead} \\hfill \\textbf{\\ttfamily\\normalsize\\color{color1} 11/2023 - 06/2025}\\\\\n\\textbf{\\ttfamily\\small\\color{color1} PNC Financial Services (Client)} \\hfill \\textbf{\\ttfamily\\small\\color{color1} PITTSBURGH, PENNSYLVANIA}\\vspace{2pt}\\\\\n{\\itshape\\sffamily Led major architectural transformations, instituting a 'best-practice-by-default' philosophy to seamlessly bridge Android and backend systems.}\\vspace{2pt}\n\\begin{itemize}[label=\\textbullet, leftmargin=15pt, itemsep=1pt, parsep=0pt]\n    \\item {\\sffamily Coordinated cross-platform Design System governance, eliminating hardcoded UI values by mandating 100\\% semantic token adoption.}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Engineered a Gradle module-generation workflow to enforce project-wide naming conventions and prevent architectural drift.}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Created a centralized workflow with enforced PR restrictions and direct integration with string management platforms (GL Strings/Applanga).}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Crafted interactive Bash scripts to streamline feature contributions and empower teams to build independently.}\n    \\item {\\sffamily Accelerated development by enforcing a design token system, launching dynamic screen sizes, dark mode, and branded themes without increasing project scope.}\n\\end{itemize}\n}\n\n% --- PNC Security ---\n\\item{\n\\textbf{\\ttfamily\\normalsize Android Security \\& Authentication Tech Lead} \\hfill \\textbf{\\ttfamily\\normalsize\\color{color1} 08/2019 - 01/2020}\\\\\n\\textbf{\\ttfamily\\small\\color{color1} PNC Financial Services (Client)} \\hfill \\textbf{\\ttfamily\\small\\color{color1} 