n Mathematics and production expertise in Kotlin, Coroutines, Jetpack Compose, and platform-level integrations, I offer direct experience addressing EchoStar's technical priorities:}\n\n{\\raggedright\\fontspec[Path = OpenFonts/fonts/raleway/]{Raleway-Medium}\\fontsize{11pt}{13pt}\\selectfont\n\\begin{itemize}\n    \\item \\textbf{Modular Architecture \\& Codebase Scalability:} Decomposed a monolithic enterprise Android codebase (3.5M+ MAU) from a single ``god-module'' into an organized multi-module repository, cutting build times by 70\\% and instituting automated module-generation workflows to enforce architectural boundaries.\n    \\item \\textbf{System Observability \\& Fleet Telemetry:} Designed custom observability patterns and telemetry instrumentation to isolate bottlenecks in complex user flows, reduce issue reproduction time, and safeguard mission-critical mobile-to-backend interfaces against field regressions.\n    \\item \\textbf{Platform-Level Integrations \\& Hardware Coordination:} Engineered resilient peripheral communication integrating paired Bluetooth (BLE) hardware with custom SDKs, and authored an Android FIDO authenticator proof-of-concept that established institutional adoption of Samsung Knox and MFA.\n    \\item \\textbf{Engineering Standards, DevEx \\& AI Workflows:} Instituted a ``best-practice-by-default'' philosophy, automated credential setups reducing onboarding time by 80\\%, published the technical series \\myhref{https://blog.fnc314.dev}{\\textit{\"Taming the Elephant Herd\"}} on build optimization, and integrated Claude Code into independent prototyping workflows with rigorous validation gates.\n\\end{itemize}\\par}\n\\vspace{6pt}\n\n\\lettercontent{While my enterprise production work centered on high-volume financial platforms and connected peripherals rather than dedicated set-top box or Android TV media engines, the core engineering imperatives are identical: strict lifecycle discipline, low-latency streaming interfaces, resilient error handling, and robust telemetry across distributed hardware fleets. I welcome the opportunity to participate in a technical assessment or whiteboarding session and discuss how my platform background aligns with EchoStar's streaming reliability and connectivity goals.}\n\n\\begin{flushright}\n\\closing{Kind regards,}\n\n\\signature{Franco N. Colaizzi}\n\\end{flushright}\n\\end{document}\n"
